        690.3865966796875,
        211.5760955810547
      ],
      "text": "Although one of the trials was conducted in low TB incidence countries, this is unlikely to affect the relative effect of rifapentine + isoniazid compared with isoniazid monotherapy. Not downgraded.  a",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
