        210.97610473632812,
        359.4762268066406,
        220.5760955810547
      ],
      "text": "95% CIs of both relative and absolute effect include appreciable benefit and harm with 3HP.  b",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        219.97610473632812,
        374.2099609375,
        229.5760955810547
      ],
      "text": "Both trials were open-label, which may have introduced bias in ascertainment of adverse events.  c",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
