        228.97610473632812,
        616.1941528320312,
        238.5760955810547
      ],
      "text": "Although the trials were open-label, this is unlikely to affect detection of hepatotoxicity, which is usually done by objective measurement (i.e. blood tests.). Not downgraded.  d",
